/target
**/*.bak
.DS_Store
# Solo-maintained tool; external coworkers consume the built binary/dylib via
# FFI (from meow-tower / meow-toolbox), not the source. No shared-build
# reproducibility need, and the local-checkout patches in ~/.cargo/config.toml
# add `[[patch.unused]]` markers to every cargo run, so a tracked lockfile
# would churn on every invocation. Each `just install` regenerates a fresh
# lockfile locally. If a transitive dep ever needs pinning, do it in
# Cargo.toml via `cargo update -p <crate> --precise <ver>`.
Cargo.lock
